      "title": "正面提示词 (FLUX 自然语言)",
      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"},
      "widgets_values": [
        "A minimalist game UI icon for a cultivation RPG, centered composition. Subject: a single stylized vermilion red flame rising upward, the flame silhouette curling at the top to suggest a fox tail shape. The base of the flame has a bright golden core glow #FFD700. The flame occupies about 60 percent of the canvas in the center, with generous empty space around it. Behind the flame is a very simple thin circular gold border ring, decorative but not ornate. Pure clean solid white background, no other elements. Flat vector illustration style, painted with traditional Chinese ink wash brushstrokes but extremely simplified for icon use. Vermilion red and gold color palette only. No animals, no creatures, no foxes, no characters, no complex patterns, no maze patterns, no ornate frames, no text, no multiple subjects. Single focal point on the flame. Designed to be readable when scaled down to 64x64 pixels. Symmetric and balanced composition. Highest quality concept art for game UI."
      ],
      "color": "#232",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
    },
