    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [50, 500],
      "size": [320, 480],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 12,
      "mode": 0,
      "title": "FLUX 图标工作流说明",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "■ 工作流: FLUX 五行图标 (推荐主用)\n   稳定性 / 服从度 远超 SDXL 版\n\n■ M4 Pro 单张预期:\n   1024x1024 / 25 步 -> 约 3-5 分钟\n   (FLUX 在 Apple Silicon 较慢但出图稳)\n\n■ 五行提示词替换速查 (替换主体描述):\n\n[金 Metal]\n  a single stylized bronze sword blade vertical in center, sharp clean metallic silver and ancient bronze tones, simple gold ring border\n\n[木 Wood]\n  a single stylized bamboo leaf curling upward in center, vibrant pine green and deep forest green, simple gold ring border\n\n[水 Water]\n  a single stylized blue water droplet rising upward in center, indigo blue and pale white tones, simple gold ring border\n\n[火 Fire]\n  a single stylized vermilion red flame curling upward, vermilion red and golden core (当前)\n\n[土 Earth]\n  a single stylized mountain peak triangular shape in center, ochre yellow and earth brown tones, simple gold ring border\n\n■ 关键改动 vs SDXL 版:\n   - 提示词改为长自然语言 (FLUX 强项)\n   - 强调 single subject / no animals\n   - 大量 no patterns / no ornate frames 约束\n   - CFG = 1.0 (FLUX 必须)\n\n■ 文件名约定 (在 SaveImage 节点修改):\n   element_icon_metal / wood / water / fire / earth\n\n■ 提速:\n   换 flux1-schnell.safetensors + 步数=4\n   单张 ~1 分钟, 质量略降"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
